Mon Aug 24 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - Lyra OS Release <rodrigo@lyraos.com.br>

- Register Microsoft's official Visual Studio Code Zypper repository,
  trusted through the microsoft key that distribution-gpg-keys ships.
- Ship no VS Code binary: Microsoft's EULA does not allow redistributing
  their official build, so this package only makes `zypper install code`
  resolve against packages.microsoft.com.
- Declare %dir ownership of /etc/zypp and /etc/zypp/repos.d directly
  (neither zypper nor libzypp actually owns them via RPM metadata).
